{"ticker":{"symbol":"039980.KQ","name":"폴라리스AI","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":4365.0,"change_pct":-0.053145336225596584,"market_cap":62773997568.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":12450.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":null,"website":"https://www.leenos.co.kr","business_summary":"Polaris AI Corp., together with its subsidiaries, operates in the fashion and information technology (IT) businesses in South Korea and internationally. The company offers system integration solutions, IT solutions, wireless communications, and IT services to government public institutions and transportation infrastructure enterprises. It also sells casual bags under the Kipling and Eastpack brand names through its department stores, outlets, and duty-free shops, as well as online. The company was formerly known as Leenos Corp. and changed its name to Polaris AI Corp. in February 2024. Polaris AI Corp. was founded in 1991 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"Polaris AI Corp.는 자회사와 함께 한국 및 해외에서 패션 및 정보 기술(IT) 사업을 운영하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 정부 공공 기관 및 교통 인프라 기업에 시스템 통합 솔루션, IT 솔루션, 무선 통신 및 IT 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 키플링, 이스트팩이라는 브랜드로 캐주얼 가방을 백화점, 아울렛, 면세점은 물론 온라인에서도 판매하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Leenos Corp.로 알려졌으며 2024년 2월 Polaris AI Corp.로 사명을 변경했습니다. Polaris AI Corp.는 1991년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"IT 서비스","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":80853888090.0,"operating_income":-2360088910.0,"net_income":-2833125720.0,"eps":-315.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":59435979920.0,"operating_income":1458860330.0,"net_income":919824490.0,"eps":100.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":53068929660.0,"operating_income":-1273144780.0,"net_income":14168284